  "details": "1. Enable Camera Face Capture on PC\n\n2. Set capture quality to any level higher than \"Performance\"\n\n3. Join a world that uses its own independent hand/pose controls (not using Shift+F1~F8 hotkeys) to trigger avatar hand animations\n\nExpected result:\n\nThe world's built-in hand and pose animations should work normally. Expressions should remain unaffected.\n\nActual result:\n\nWhen capture quality is above Performance, the face capture system locks the Shift+F1-F8 gesture state to fists.\n\nThis blocks the world's independent hand control animations from displaying correctly for the local user.\n\nImportant: Other players can see the animations playing properly. This bug only affects the local player's view. Expressions are not locked.\n\nAdditional information:\n\nThe issue disappears after switching capture quality back to \"Performance\".",
